+"""Code that would show a secret (design §6.7): env values reaching an output (L011), and shown
+names that say they hold a secret (L014).
+
+A taint walk over one cell: sources (``os.environ``, ``getenv``, ``dotenv_values``, secret-showing
+magics) taint names; sinks (the last expression, ``print``/``display``, logging, tracebacks, shell
+output) report what reaches them. It reads code only, never a value. Stdlib plus
+``_shared.secrets``.
+"""
+
+from __future__ import annotations
+
